Subject: [PATCH] Rt2d review fixes (delta on top of 0012)

F1 gradient truncation, F2 float-per-op widths, F3 show accumulation order, F4 SetCamera nil/failure, F5 Im2D sink states,
F6 Path::close, F7 adaptive curve flattening, F8 texture read fallback + default font dictionary, F10 header comment,
F11 StreamMemory::read8/write8. Adds tests/diff_rt2d differential harness. See MFL_NOTES.md "Rt2d review".
